              "answers": [
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>No, the condition of soft and flexible bones is osteomalacia (in adults) or rickets (in children). Osteoporosis is a condition of too little bone.&nbsp;</div>\n",
                    "notChosenFeedback": "<div>Indeed, the condition of soft and flexible bones is osteomalacia (in adults) or rickets (in children). Osteoporosis is a condition of too little bone.</div>\n",
                    "tip": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>Osteoporosis is the condition of soft and flexible bone. </div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "Weight bearing exercises are the type of exercise that appears to promote bone growth the most. A sedentary lifestyle is a risk for developing osteoporosis\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": false,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "<div>The reason that female gender is a risk factor for osteoporosis is because oestrogen is not as strong a stimulus for bone growth as compared to testosterone.&nbsp;</div>\n"
                },
                {
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
                  },
                  "text": "Corticosteroids (glucocorticoids) such as prednisone significantly contribute to osteoporosis \n"
                }
